OL,3,AWhat we know about the Dubai-Israel
OL,4,Aplane incident after reported stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA flight from Dubai to Tel Aviv was
OL,7,Funexpectedly diverted to Saudi Arabia
OL,8,Fafter a pilot was stabbed, Israeli
OL,9,Fofficials have told local media.
OL,11,FThe Flydubai plane - which took off
OL,12,Ffrom Dubai International Airport in the
OL,13,FUnited Arab Emirates early on Wednesday
OL,14,Fmorning - signalled an emergency alert
OL,15,Ftwo hours into the flight.
OL,17,FTracking data also showed a sudden drop
OL,18,Fin the plane's altitude.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
