OL,3,AWhat we know about the Dubai-Israel
OL,4,Aplane incident after reported stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlight FZ1073 - carrying around 150
OL,7,Fpeople, most of whom are Israeli - was
OL,8,Fforced to change course from its route
OL,9,Fto Ben-Gurion Airport in Israel and
OL,10,Finstead landed at Tabuk Airport in
OL,11,Fnortheastern Saudi Arabia.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
